# Python-generated files
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info

# Virtual environments
.venv

# Scratch from probing providers by hand. Fifteen of these were committed at
# the root — 87MB, most of it one CPI dump — which is what an install actually
# costs someone before they see a line of the server.
#
# Anchored to the root on purpose. Bare *.json would also swallow a fixture
# somebody meant to add, and a file that silently fails to be committed is the
# same class of quiet failure this repo exists to complain about.
/*.csv
/*.json
/*.xml
/*.html
/*.txt
